{
  "title": "Dragon duel",
  "about": "A red fire dragon and a blue ice dragon, long eastern serpents with horns, whiskers, manes, fins and little clawed legs, swirl round each other in a tilted orbit. Every four bars they take turns: the red one breathes fire, the blue one breathes ice, a bar of swirling, then both at once and the blasts clash in the middle in a burst of steam and sparks, all pulsing on the kick. Through a build the orbit tightens and speeds up and the breaths come twice as often; on the drop (and on its own every few bars) they curl into a heart and kiss nose to nose in a burst of purple light. Breakdowns go slow and dreamy.",
  "climax": {"cycle": "every", "peak": "1 - 8 / every", "lock": "droplock", "what": "the kiss"},
